sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer as PER-001 (Customer)
    participant Channel as Mobile App / Web Portal<br/>(Channel)
    participant IAM as SVC-100<br/>IAM
    participant PayOpsAPI as CAP-003<br/>Payment Operations API
    participant EventBus as SVC-102<br/>Event Bus
    participant RetailAPI as CAP-001<br/>Retail Banking API
    participant Notifications as SVC-053<br/>Notification Service
    participant Audit as SVC-103<br/>Audit & Logging
    participant BACS as BACS / Vocalink<br/>(External Scheme)

    Note over Customer,BACS: PH-046 — DDI Setup (customer-initiated, digital channel)

    Customer->>Channel: Navigate to Direct Debits → Add Direct Debit<br/>Enter: BRITISH GAS, SUN 123456, ref BGS-001234567, variable amount, 2026-05-15
    Channel-->>Customer: Display DDI summary — prompt SCA

    Customer->>Channel: Complete SCA (FIDO2 biometric — authorises DDI setup)
    Channel->>IAM: POST /sca/validate {assertion, context: direct_debit_setup}
    IAM-->>Channel: 200 OK {sca_assertion_ref, valid: true}

    Channel->>PayOpsAPI: POST /payments/v1/direct-debits {account_id, originator_name: BRITISH GAS,<br/>originator_sun: 123456, reference: BGS-001234567, amount_type: variable, sca_assertion_ref}
    Note right of PayOpsAPI: SVC-009 validates SCA assertion.<br/>Creates ENT-034 (status: pending).<br/>Schedules AUDDIS 0N submission.
    PayOpsAPI-->>Channel: 202 Accepted {ddi_id, status: pending, poll_url}

    PayOpsAPI->>EventBus: Publish DirectDebitInstructionCreated (EVT-069)
    EventBus->>Audit: Write EVT-069 to WORM audit log
    Channel-->>Customer: Show "Your Direct Debit is being set up" confirmation

    Note over Customer,BACS: PH-047 — DDI Validation (AUDDIS submission to BACS)

    PayOpsAPI->>BACS: Submit AUDDIS 0N {sort_code, account_number, originator_sun: 123456, reference: BGS-001234567}
    Note right of BACS: BACS validates originator SUN,<br/>account eligibility, and routes instruction<br/>to paying bank (this bank as paying PSP).
    BACS-->>PayOpsAPI: AUDDIS 0N accepted — processing within BACS cycle

    Note over Customer,BACS: PH-048 — DDI Confirmation (async — T+1 to T+3 working days)

    BACS-->>PayOpsAPI: ADDACS confirmation: DDI registered, bacs_reference: BACS-DD-2026-04-15-001
    Note right of PayOpsAPI: SVC-009 updates ENT-034.status = active.<br/>Records bacs_reference.

    PayOpsAPI->>EventBus: Publish DirectDebitInstructionValidated (EVT-070) {ddi_id, bacs_reference, status: active}
    EventBus->>Audit: Write EVT-070 to WORM audit log

    par Account management updated
        EventBus->>RetailAPI: Consume EVT-070 → DDI active in account dashboard
    and Customer notification dispatched
        EventBus->>Notifications: Consume EVT-070 → send DDI confirmation + DD Guarantee summary
        Notifications-->>Customer: Push + email: "Your Direct Debit to BRITISH GAS is now active.<br/>BACS ref: BACS-DD-2026-04-15-001. [Direct Debit Guarantee rights]"
    end

    Note over Customer,BACS: PH-049 — First Collection Submission (D-2: 13 May 2026)

    BACS-->>PayOpsAPI: BACS collection file received from originator (D-2):<br/>£87.50 to be collected on 15 May 2026
    Note right of PayOpsAPI: SVC-009 validates collection against ENT-034.<br/>Creates ENT-035 (status: submitted).

    PayOpsAPI->>EventBus: Publish DirectDebitCollectionSubmitted (EVT-071) {collection_id, amount: 87.50, collection_date: 2026-05-15}
    EventBus->>Audit: Write EVT-071 to WORM audit log

    par Upcoming transaction visible
        EventBus->>RetailAPI: Consume EVT-071 → surface pending DD in upcoming transactions
    and Advance notice to customer
        EventBus->>Notifications: Consume EVT-071 → send advance notice
        Notifications-->>Customer: "BRITISH GAS will collect £87.50 on 15 May 2026"
    end

    Note over Customer,BACS: PH-050 — Collection Processing (D-0: 15 May 2026)

    PayOpsAPI->>EventBus: Publish DirectDebitDebitRequested (cross-capability) {collection_id, account_id, amount: 87.50}
    Note right of EventBus: Cross-capability async event.<br/>CAP-003 (SVC-009) → CAP-001 (SVC-001).<br/>No direct service-to-service call.

    EventBus->>RetailAPI: Consume DirectDebitDebitRequested → check balance (£312.00 >= £87.50) → debit account
    Note right of RetailAPI: SVC-001 debits account ledger £87.50.<br/>Updates daily_payment_total.

    RetailAPI->>EventBus: Publish AccountDebited {account_id, amount: 87.50, debit_type: direct_debit, collection_id}

    EventBus->>PayOpsAPI: Consume AccountDebited → update ENT-035.status = collected

    PayOpsAPI->>EventBus: Publish DirectDebitCollectionProcessed (EVT-072) {collection_id, amount: 87.50, status: collected}
    EventBus->>Audit: Write EVT-072 to WORM audit log

    EventBus->>Notifications: Consume EVT-072 → send post-collection confirmation
    Notifications-->>Customer: "BRITISH GAS collected £87.50 on 15 May 2026"

    Note over Customer,BACS: Journey complete — DDI active, first collection processed successfully
